       }
      },
      "totalDuration": "3 yrs 8 mos",
      "description": "Responsible for environmental monitoring software on ASR1001-X\n• Collaborated with HW and manufacturing teams to ensure safe and reliable power and fan requirements \n• Wrote software to control fan settings based on temperature readings\n• Created and executed detailed test plan documentation\nDeveloped and maintained production environment register access tool for all generations of the QFP ASIC\n• Tool was, and still is, one of the most used debug tools for all QFP related challenges\n• Instrumental in analyzing and diagnosing complex performance issues\n• Created a scripting interface so users could write their own register scripts to extract targeted data",
